WEBVTT

01:34.920 --> 01:38.320
ADAPTED FROM DEMON KING
OF JINJIANG LITERATURE CITY

01:38.400 --> 01:40.840
ORIGINAL WORK BY JIULU FEIXIANG

01:48.040 --> 01:50.200
You're so excited
about getting married to Changheng

01:50.280 --> 01:51.480
that you can't fall asleep?

01:52.280 --> 01:53.960
Don't forget that it's all fake.

01:54.720 --> 01:55.600
Fake.

01:57.080 --> 01:58.920
I don't care if it's fake or not.

01:59.000 --> 02:01.400
I only marry the woman I like.

02:01.480 --> 02:02.800
As for others,

02:02.880 --> 02:04.480
I will not even look at them,

02:04.560 --> 02:06.080
not to mention proposing a marriage.

02:10.960 --> 02:13.120
Moon Supreme Lord.

02:15.400 --> 02:16.960
Why didn't you even take a stand?

02:25.640 --> 02:26.880
Moon Supreme Lord, wait.

02:31.880 --> 02:32.720
Moon Supreme Lord.

02:34.640 --> 02:35.640
Moon Supreme Lord.

02:35.720 --> 02:38.360
At a time like this, can't you take care
of the overall situation?

02:38.440 --> 02:41.080
What time is it?
Are you so eager to marry Xiao Run?

02:41.160 --> 02:42.880
Wait. I should say Changheng.

02:42.960 --> 02:43.960
I…

02:44.040 --> 02:46.080
I'm trying to save both of their lives.

02:46.640 --> 02:49.440
Besides, don't you also want
the plan to succeed?

02:49.520 --> 02:51.360
My plan will not be built on marriage.

02:52.720 --> 02:54.480
I'm not as casual as you are.

02:55.840 --> 02:57.080
Who are you calling casual?

02:58.840 --> 02:59.760
My lord.

03:00.640 --> 03:01.640
My lord.

03:01.720 --> 03:02.880
Lady Wanqing is here.

03:02.960 --> 03:04.480
She's outside right now.

03:04.560 --> 03:05.480
Why is she here?

03:06.240 --> 03:08.360
She said she has come to propose

03:08.440 --> 03:09.400
to you.

03:12.440 --> 03:13.320
Just in time.

03:13.400 --> 03:15.280
That's right. Just in time.

03:15.840 --> 03:18.520
I'll go tell her to give up the idea now.

03:18.600 --> 03:20.080
No!

03:20.160 --> 03:21.960
Moon Supreme Lord, I'm begging you.

03:23.960 --> 03:25.200
Big Blockhead, stop there.

03:40.600 --> 03:41.600
I'm telling you.

03:41.680 --> 03:43.560
Go with me to see Lady Wanqing later.

03:43.640 --> 03:45.560
And don't say a word.

03:46.240 --> 03:47.400
How dare you command…

03:54.640 --> 03:56.240
Not even one of you can make me relieved.

04:11.600 --> 04:12.720
Sir, I've come to meet you.

04:18.399 --> 04:20.000
There is no need for that here.

04:20.079 --> 04:21.399
Hurry up. Please have a seat.

04:30.560 --> 04:33.400
I'm sorry to bother you uninvited.

04:34.040 --> 04:36.680
I wonder if you will blame me
for being rash?

04:41.720 --> 04:42.560
Of course not.

04:43.240 --> 04:44.360
We are more than happy

04:44.440 --> 04:46.440
that you're here.

04:49.120 --> 04:51.600
But sir, why won't you turn around
and look at me?

04:51.680 --> 04:53.680
And why won't you say anything?

04:55.800 --> 04:58.920
My brother is easily shy.

04:59.000 --> 05:00.920
Lady Wanqing, have some tea.

05:09.160 --> 05:10.400
That's right.

05:10.480 --> 05:12.400
You're a gentleman.

05:13.800 --> 05:16.320
I've been straightforward
about the reason for my visit.

05:16.880 --> 05:18.880
I wonder what you think.

05:19.640 --> 05:22.240
Will you dislike me
for being a mere street woman?

05:25.240 --> 05:27.120
If you have any reluctance in your heart,

05:27.200 --> 05:28.880
you must tell me.

05:34.920 --> 05:36.280
How could he dislike you?

05:36.360 --> 05:38.440
I should tell you.

05:38.520 --> 05:40.880
Before you came,
my brother and I were also discussing

05:40.960 --> 05:42.320
about proposing marriage to you.

05:42.400 --> 05:44.560
I didn't expect you to come first.

05:49.160 --> 05:50.120
Really?

05:51.320 --> 05:52.520
Of course it's true.

05:53.400 --> 05:55.320
Brother, why are you staring at me?

05:55.400 --> 05:58.600
Didn't you just say you wanted
to marry Lady Wanqing

05:58.680 --> 06:01.080
as my sister-in-law
with big dowry and eight palanquins?

06:01.600 --> 06:02.840
Now that she's here,

06:02.920 --> 06:04.640
why are you so shy?

06:07.080 --> 06:08.520
Lady Wanqing. Look.

06:08.600 --> 06:10.840
My brother is blushing.

06:18.800 --> 06:21.600
I just wanted to tell you my feelings.

06:21.680 --> 06:23.440
Even if I hadn't won your love,

06:23.520 --> 06:25.320
I'd have no regrets.

06:25.400 --> 06:26.600
It turns out

06:26.680 --> 06:28.440
it's not just that I'm in love,

06:29.160 --> 06:30.400
you have the same feelings too.

06:31.360 --> 06:33.240
The savings I've made
over the past ten years

06:33.320 --> 06:34.800
have all been used to pay for my life.

06:35.800 --> 06:37.320
Although these three pieces of silk

06:37.400 --> 06:38.640
are not worth big money,

06:39.360 --> 06:41.480
they were weaved with my own hands

06:41.560 --> 06:43.960
since I've met and missed you.

06:44.040 --> 06:45.400
This would be my dowry.

06:45.480 --> 06:47.240
They're as plain as snow.

06:47.320 --> 06:49.640
Although I was a street girl,

06:50.280 --> 06:51.840
I've never fallen.

06:53.880 --> 06:55.200
I hope you'll accept them.

07:02.240 --> 07:04.720
This is my birth date and horoscope.

07:04.800 --> 07:08.000
Although there is no parental order
or matchmaker's agreement,

07:08.080 --> 07:10.240
the rituals must be followed.

07:11.720 --> 07:12.560
Sir.

07:13.520 --> 07:15.040
Brother, take it.

07:22.720 --> 07:24.320
I'll take it.

07:31.000 --> 07:34.160
The birthdate should be
mutually exchanged.

07:34.240 --> 07:36.040
I took the liberty of coming today.

07:36.120 --> 07:38.040
You haven't written it yet.

07:38.120 --> 07:39.640
I'm sorry I didn't think it through.

07:42.280 --> 07:43.480
Tomorrow night,

07:44.040 --> 07:46.040
I'll enjoy the moon in the lake.

07:47.120 --> 07:48.440
If you finish it,

07:48.520 --> 07:51.280
come and have a few drinks with me.

08:22.640 --> 08:24.080
I asked you not to say anything

08:24.160 --> 08:25.720
and you really didn't say a word.

08:25.800 --> 08:27.000
You are quite cooperative.

08:28.200 --> 08:29.600
Why are you glaring at me again?

08:30.200 --> 08:33.280
Who said so aggressively he wanted
Lady Wanqing to give up the idea?

08:33.360 --> 08:35.480
Why did you keep silent
while she was here?

08:35.559 --> 08:38.240
Half-refusing, half-compromising.

08:38.320 --> 08:39.960
You accused me of wanting to get married.

08:40.039 --> 08:41.559
I think you also want to marry her.

08:51.360 --> 08:53.360
I've been searching for him
all these days.

08:53.440 --> 08:54.320
I never thought

08:54.400 --> 08:56.920
the man of my dreams
would be your brother.

08:57.000 --> 08:58.360
It's a great destiny.

09:01.160 --> 09:02.320
Lady Orchid.

09:02.920 --> 09:05.440
You look unhappy.
Do you have something on your mind?

09:06.200 --> 09:07.080
No, nothing.

09:07.760 --> 09:10.600
Of course I'm happy for you
seeing that you and your love

09:10.680 --> 09:12.120
are getting married.

09:12.880 --> 09:14.200
It's just…

09:14.280 --> 09:15.240
Just what?

09:17.320 --> 09:18.600
Lady Wanqing.

09:19.120 --> 09:20.320
Actually, I…

09:20.400 --> 09:21.600
I have a friend

09:22.160 --> 09:26.200
who maybe, probably,

09:27.200 --> 09:28.800
has fallen in love

09:30.200 --> 09:31.120
with…

09:31.720 --> 09:32.920
Love is love.

09:33.560 --> 09:35.640
How can there be a maybe?

09:38.120 --> 09:39.160
All right.

09:39.240 --> 09:40.560
Then it's the case.

09:41.320 --> 09:43.080
She has a crush on someone.

09:43.160 --> 09:46.040
But she can't be with him

09:46.120 --> 09:47.360
because of their status.

09:47.440 --> 09:48.680
What do you think she should do?

09:48.760 --> 09:50.920
Why do you ask this question, Lady Orchid?

09:51.520 --> 09:53.600
I'm a woman from the Royal Academy.

09:53.680 --> 09:55.800
In terms of status,
I am already the humblest.

09:55.880 --> 09:58.760
But I wouldn't give up on the man I love
because of my status.

09:59.600 --> 10:01.840
She doesn't have to worry about it,
Lady Orchid.

10:01.920 --> 10:03.640
But the status I'm talking about

10:03.720 --> 10:05.320
is much more fatal than yours.

10:06.200 --> 10:08.680
If two families are deadly rivals

10:08.760 --> 10:10.440
in which neither could tolerate the other,

10:11.480 --> 10:12.680
but a person in this family…

10:13.360 --> 10:14.560
But a person in this family

10:14.640 --> 10:16.480
falls in love with someone
of the other family.

10:17.400 --> 10:19.920
Now that a battle is around the corner,

10:20.600 --> 10:23.200
they have to separate.

10:23.960 --> 10:26.680
Then these two people must be
the biggest fools in the world.

10:28.080 --> 10:28.920
Why?

10:30.880 --> 10:33.840
If they give up their heart's desire
for something other than themselves,

10:33.920 --> 10:35.560
what can they be but fools?

10:35.640 --> 10:38.080
If it were an ordinary person,
it would be fine.

10:38.920 --> 10:40.360
But the one she likes

10:40.440 --> 10:42.400
has a great mission on his shoulders

10:42.480 --> 10:44.000
that he can't give up.

10:44.680 --> 10:46.480
What should they do then?

10:47.040 --> 10:50.000
Do you mean yourself?

10:51.000 --> 10:52.040
No.

10:53.320 --> 10:54.520
Lady Wanqing.

10:54.600 --> 10:56.840
Please answer me. Can you?

10:58.800 --> 11:00.680
My answer remains the same.

11:00.760 --> 11:03.400
How many people in this world
can meet their true love?

11:03.480 --> 11:06.280
How many people can never meet
that person in their lifetime?

11:07.000 --> 11:08.080
If they do,

11:08.720 --> 11:09.880
they can't give up.

11:16.480 --> 11:19.040
RIVER VILLAS

11:23.440 --> 11:24.360
My lord.

11:25.600 --> 11:26.680
It's already midnight.

11:27.680 --> 11:28.760
Aren't you going to rest?

11:39.080 --> 11:39.920
She said "also."

11:40.000 --> 11:41.000
What does that mean?

11:43.120 --> 11:45.760
When she left, she said,
"You accused me of wanting to get married.

11:45.840 --> 11:47.800
I think you also want to marry her."

11:47.880 --> 11:49.160
Does the word "also" mean

11:49.240 --> 11:51.960
she really wants to marry Changheng?

11:55.760 --> 11:57.280
My lord, you haven't said a word.

11:57.360 --> 11:59.200
This is what you've been thinking about?

12:05.680 --> 12:07.800
Why don't you ask Fairy Orchid?

12:08.400 --> 12:09.800
I don't need to.

12:10.960 --> 12:12.080
What does it matter to me

12:12.160 --> 12:13.480
if she wants to marry or not?

12:14.480 --> 12:16.080
Even if I do ask her,

12:16.160 --> 12:17.480
what else can I do?

12:39.680 --> 12:40.560
Shangque.

12:41.480 --> 12:42.360
I'm here.

12:43.200 --> 12:44.440
In your opinion,

12:44.520 --> 12:47.160
how am I compared with Changheng?

12:48.160 --> 12:50.160
How can Changheng be compared to you?

12:51.000 --> 12:53.560
And my lord,
you've never asked such a question.

12:56.680 --> 12:58.560
I've never really thought

12:59.240 --> 13:01.640
that I would worry about not being able
to compete with others.

13:05.560 --> 13:08.760
When Changheng was the God of War,

13:08.840 --> 13:11.080
he was no match for me
in terms of strength,

13:11.160 --> 13:14.600
strategy, and spirit.

13:15.960 --> 13:17.640
Now that he has become a mortal,

13:17.720 --> 13:20.760
he's even more stupid and dumb,
eating his head off.

13:22.240 --> 13:24.440
Why does Orchid still want to marry him?

13:25.360 --> 13:27.320
Do you think she's out of her mind?

13:33.680 --> 13:34.560
That's not true.

13:35.320 --> 13:37.040
She's not smart either.

13:47.360 --> 13:48.600
She cares for Changheng

13:49.240 --> 13:51.880
and protects him from anyone's bullying.

13:52.760 --> 13:55.680
Even if he is now a mortal
with no power at all,

13:55.760 --> 13:56.960
she still…

13:58.800 --> 13:59.680
Am I

14:00.320 --> 14:02.000
that inferior to Changheng?

14:08.120 --> 14:09.440
Who do you really like?

14:09.960 --> 14:12.480
Moon Supreme Lord or Lord Changheng?

14:13.720 --> 14:16.160
Why are you asking this all of a sudden?

14:16.240 --> 14:17.160
Tell me.

14:17.800 --> 14:19.400
Can we not talk about this?

14:19.480 --> 14:22.120
Haven't we had enough troubles lately?

14:22.200 --> 14:23.720
Just tell me.

14:25.400 --> 14:28.320
Are you really in love
with Moon Supreme Lord?

14:29.400 --> 14:30.800
Do you want me

14:30.880 --> 14:31.920
to send a message for you?

14:32.000 --> 14:33.720
Don't talk nonsense.

14:33.800 --> 14:35.640
Didn't I tell you already?

14:35.720 --> 14:38.680
When I was still unformed,
I was already in love with Lord Changheng.

14:38.760 --> 14:40.360
- What about now?
- Now…

14:42.600 --> 14:44.560
I don't like Dongfang Qingcang anyway.

14:44.640 --> 14:47.000
I'm not the kind of person
who constantly changes her mind.

14:49.160 --> 14:50.520
What's wrong with a little change?

14:50.600 --> 14:53.560
Mortals can only live for a few decades
and they change their mind.

14:53.640 --> 14:55.480
We can both live 100,000 years.

14:55.560 --> 14:57.840
If we stay the same
and always like the same person,

14:57.920 --> 14:59.840
that would be boring.

15:00.560 --> 15:01.960
What about you?

15:02.040 --> 15:04.480
You were always pestering Shangque before.

15:04.560 --> 15:06.680
Now all you talk about is Qu Shui.

15:06.760 --> 15:09.000
Have you changed your mind
and like Qu Shui now?

15:09.080 --> 15:11.160
That's nonsense. I don't like Qu Shui.

15:11.240 --> 15:12.880
Then you must like Shangque.

15:12.960 --> 15:15.640
They are both just my companions
for a good time.

15:15.720 --> 15:17.080
I don't like either of them.

15:19.480 --> 15:21.360
Anyway, I should tell you.

15:21.440 --> 15:24.200
Qu Shui is only a man in this life.

15:24.280 --> 15:26.920
After he succeeds in reincarnation,
he will become Fairy Danyin.

15:27.000 --> 15:28.040
He'll be a female.

15:28.800 --> 15:30.200
I know.

15:37.920 --> 15:38.800
My lord.

15:39.600 --> 15:41.200
Orchid has gone to sleep.

15:41.280 --> 15:42.680
My lord, you've heard

15:43.320 --> 15:44.600
everything she said just now?

15:45.680 --> 15:48.000
Do you want me to repeat it?

15:48.080 --> 15:49.080
I'm not deaf.

15:54.880 --> 15:56.760
My lord,
you don't have to be so frustrated.

15:57.360 --> 15:59.960
A girl often says things she doesn't mean

16:00.040 --> 16:02.040
when facing the person she likes.

16:02.120 --> 16:03.960
What she says and what she thinks
in her heart

16:04.520 --> 16:06.400
may be completely opposite.

16:07.480 --> 16:08.320
What do you mean?

16:09.360 --> 16:10.720
I mean,

16:11.520 --> 16:14.120
for example,
if she says she's not angry with you,

16:14.200 --> 16:15.760
in fact, it means she is.

16:16.400 --> 16:19.160
If she says it's nothing
and wants to be alone for a while,

16:19.240 --> 16:21.400
then it means
she wants you to stay with her.

16:21.960 --> 16:23.440
If she says she doesn't want a gift,

16:23.520 --> 16:24.920
it means she does.

16:25.640 --> 16:27.960
And if she says she doesn't like you,

16:28.040 --> 16:29.400
actually it means

16:29.480 --> 16:30.720
she may do.

16:32.600 --> 16:33.760
There is this kind of thing?

16:35.480 --> 16:38.160
So how can I tell

16:38.240 --> 16:40.600
which statement is true and which is not?

16:42.680 --> 16:44.040
Well…

16:44.760 --> 16:46.640
A girl's mind

16:46.720 --> 16:48.680
is the most difficult to guess.

16:49.400 --> 16:50.280
Well…

16:50.920 --> 16:52.120
I can't say.

16:58.080 --> 16:59.800
This is so complicated

17:00.600 --> 17:01.960
that even my lord is at a loss.

17:04.079 --> 17:05.200
I see.

17:05.280 --> 17:07.319
My lord, you and Orchid
are heart-connected, right?

17:07.400 --> 17:09.560
It's just that
you're wearing the Jade Ring

17:09.640 --> 17:11.119
and Orchid, the Heart-Hiding Hairpin,

17:11.200 --> 17:13.520
so you can't read her mind.

17:13.599 --> 17:16.359
If you take off the Jade Ring

17:16.440 --> 17:18.760
and then replace Orchid's
Heart-Hiding Hairpin,

17:18.839 --> 17:21.800
you'll know what she's thinking
without trying to guess.

17:50.760 --> 17:52.200
Is what you said just now

17:53.160 --> 17:54.400
a lie too?

17:55.080 --> 17:55.960
What lie?

17:56.920 --> 17:58.520
You said to Fairy Orchid

17:58.600 --> 17:59.600
that you don't like me.

18:01.480 --> 18:02.600
You mean this?

18:03.160 --> 18:05.360
You said girls always say
what they don't mean.

18:06.080 --> 18:08.120
Maybe it's not true that Fairy Orchid says

18:08.200 --> 18:09.400
she doesn't like Moon Supreme Lord.

18:10.000 --> 18:11.560
Then you said you don't like me.

18:11.640 --> 18:12.520
Is it…

18:14.600 --> 18:15.800
also a lie?

18:17.040 --> 18:18.040
No.

18:18.120 --> 18:19.960
I'm not like other girls.

18:20.040 --> 18:21.320
I mean it

18:21.400 --> 18:22.520
when I say I don't like you.

18:23.400 --> 18:24.280
Why?

18:25.240 --> 18:26.720
You wouldn't understand if I told you.

18:26.800 --> 18:28.400
- I'm going to bed.
- Wait, Jieli.

18:33.280 --> 18:35.320
You used to tease me all the time,
calling me stupid.

18:35.400 --> 18:36.920
And you wouldn't talk to me seriously.

18:37.000 --> 18:38.640
Then why don't you tell me today?

18:39.120 --> 18:41.560
If you don't tell me,
how do you know I don't understand?

19:33.960 --> 19:35.280
Actually, you're not stupid.

19:35.360 --> 19:38.480
You're just too straightforward
and clean-hearted.

19:38.560 --> 19:39.680
You're not like me.

19:41.000 --> 19:42.320
What's the difference?

19:42.400 --> 19:44.320
I think my heart and your heart

19:44.400 --> 19:45.440
are the same.

19:46.600 --> 19:48.080
I don't have a heart at all.

19:48.880 --> 19:50.040
My heart and soul

19:50.120 --> 19:52.120
were taken to a pawnshop
and sold for a living

19:52.200 --> 19:53.720
when I was starving and freezing.

19:53.800 --> 19:55.720
Who do I like or dislike?

19:55.800 --> 19:56.840
To me,

19:56.920 --> 19:58.760
feelings are just a passing flicker.

19:59.800 --> 20:01.200
It's not worth believing in.

20:02.200 --> 20:03.400
Then what do you believe in?

20:04.600 --> 20:05.560
Money.

20:05.640 --> 20:07.000
I only believe in money.

20:07.080 --> 20:09.400
I just want to make money, be rich,

20:09.480 --> 20:11.680
have my own big house,
big stores, and big business,

20:11.760 --> 20:14.480
have branches across all three realms,

20:15.400 --> 20:16.800
so that I can feel safe.

20:18.360 --> 20:20.200
As for the rest,

20:21.600 --> 20:22.960
I don't want to think about it.

20:29.680 --> 20:31.160
I won't like anyone

20:31.240 --> 20:32.800
in my life at all.

20:33.680 --> 20:34.680
Do you understand?

20:38.680 --> 20:39.640
I don't.

20:42.880 --> 20:44.520
I knew you wouldn't understand.

20:44.600 --> 20:45.560
Stupid Black Dragon.

20:46.520 --> 20:47.920
Don't think about it.

20:48.000 --> 20:49.320
Go to bed early.

21:10.760 --> 21:11.600
Dongfang.

21:12.720 --> 21:13.560
Dongfang.

21:15.400 --> 21:16.280
Dongfang.

21:17.640 --> 21:18.520
Dongfang.

21:22.400 --> 21:24.080
Why are you here so early in the morning?

21:25.160 --> 21:27.720
It's a beautiful day,
a good time to go for a walk.

21:28.360 --> 21:30.040
I'm going to take Lady Orchid
out for a walk

21:30.120 --> 21:31.320
and spend some time with her.

21:32.080 --> 21:34.880
I've already agreed to your marriage.
Why still spend time together?

21:34.960 --> 21:36.720
Dongfang, you're wrong on this.

21:36.800 --> 21:39.240
See? Although it's said
that brothers are like fathers,

21:39.320 --> 21:42.560
the important matter of marriage needs
to be approved by Lady Orchid herself.

21:42.640 --> 21:44.400
She knows very little about me.

21:44.480 --> 21:46.280
I should at least let her
get to know me first.

21:46.960 --> 21:48.200
- Absolutely…
- Lady Orchid.

22:08.640 --> 22:10.280
Orchid, there are sugar cakes over there.

22:13.600 --> 22:14.760
Do you want a sugar cake?

22:19.400 --> 22:20.560
It's hot!

22:22.040 --> 22:23.400
Why is it so hot?

22:24.360 --> 22:26.040
Don't grab it with your hands from now on.

22:26.120 --> 22:27.600
You can't even think of a way
not to get burned.

22:27.680 --> 22:28.520
You're stupid indeed.

22:33.120 --> 22:34.640
Forget it. I'm not hungry.

22:35.280 --> 22:36.480
Flowers.

22:37.120 --> 22:38.320
Flowers.

22:39.120 --> 22:41.280
- There are flowers for sale there.
- Flowers.

22:42.440 --> 22:44.320
Flowers.

22:44.400 --> 22:47.320
Camellia in early spring.

22:49.680 --> 22:51.840
Orchid. See which one you like.

22:55.040 --> 22:56.840
Sir, please buy some flowers.

22:56.920 --> 22:58.160
Turn around.

23:14.560 --> 23:15.520
No need.

23:15.600 --> 23:16.600
I don't like flowers.

23:20.360 --> 23:21.400
That makes sense.

23:21.480 --> 23:23.320
You're the best florist in Jinling.

23:23.400 --> 23:25.360
These ordinary flowers
are not enough for you.

23:26.680 --> 23:28.480
Why don't I take you on a boat trip?

23:32.760 --> 23:33.720
I…

23:34.480 --> 23:35.880
I'll miss you too.

23:38.840 --> 23:40.000
Daqiang.

23:42.000 --> 23:43.000
Bye.

23:46.360 --> 23:48.240
Lady Orchid, are you all right?

24:01.720 --> 24:02.720
My lord.

24:02.800 --> 24:04.960
What's the state of mind
of Fairy Orchid at this moment?

24:05.560 --> 24:07.000
Changheng is pursuing her like this.

24:07.080 --> 24:08.280
Is she happy?

24:09.400 --> 24:10.400
I don't know.

24:11.520 --> 24:13.080
But last night, didn't you…

24:58.360 --> 25:00.320
You didn't replace
the Heart-Hiding Hairpin?

25:00.400 --> 25:01.600
No.

25:04.760 --> 25:08.200
Orchid always says I'm superior,
high and mighty,

25:08.280 --> 25:09.760
and don't understand her heart.

25:10.560 --> 25:11.640
I don't believe

25:12.280 --> 25:13.640
if I don't rely on One Heart Curse,

25:13.720 --> 25:16.200
I won't understand what she's thinking.

26:01.040 --> 26:02.640
Why aren't you saying anything?

26:04.680 --> 26:06.400
Is there something I'm not doing well

26:06.480 --> 26:07.360
that upsets you?

26:42.120 --> 26:43.000
Orchid.

26:46.400 --> 26:47.440
No.

26:47.520 --> 26:48.800
Once upon a time,

26:49.800 --> 26:52.200
I always looked forward

26:53.320 --> 26:55.120
to spending all day with you,

26:55.960 --> 26:57.040
listening to you talk,

26:57.120 --> 26:58.720
and walking with you.

27:00.640 --> 27:02.640
I dared not even think

27:04.320 --> 27:06.240
how happy I would be

27:06.320 --> 27:07.880
to have a day like today.

27:08.800 --> 27:09.920
Once upon a time?

27:10.760 --> 27:12.440
You've known me before?

27:14.720 --> 27:16.200
I've known you for a long time.

27:17.240 --> 27:18.560
I've known you

27:18.640 --> 27:19.920
before you knew me.

27:22.680 --> 27:23.760
I don't remember.

27:24.800 --> 27:26.600
But when I was a child,

27:26.680 --> 27:28.400
I went to Jinling with my father.

27:28.480 --> 27:30.040
That was a long time ago.

27:31.000 --> 27:32.960
It doesn't matter
if I don't remember the past.

27:33.040 --> 27:34.360
What matters is the future.

27:38.360 --> 27:41.920
I carried this jade in my birth coat.

27:42.000 --> 27:43.440
People say

27:43.520 --> 27:45.400
it represents
my future wealth and prosperity.

27:46.600 --> 27:47.760
But I always feel

27:47.840 --> 27:49.240
it doesn't belong to me.

27:49.320 --> 27:50.760
I'm only keeping it temporarily.

27:52.360 --> 27:54.040
It should belong

27:54.800 --> 27:56.000
to the one I really love.

27:57.000 --> 27:58.360
It wasn't until I met you

27:59.040 --> 28:00.080
that I realized

28:01.320 --> 28:02.600
you must be its owner.

28:11.480 --> 28:13.080
Orchid, please take it.

28:24.280 --> 28:26.560
And Lord Changheng praised me.

28:26.640 --> 28:28.200
He said I'm a role model

28:28.280 --> 28:30.760
for all fairies of Shuiyuntian.

28:30.840 --> 28:33.080
He even gave me the Firefly Stone.

28:34.720 --> 28:37.040
Think about it. What a coincidence?

28:37.120 --> 28:40.360
Why did the fireflies fly
to my garden at Arbiter Hall

28:40.440 --> 28:41.720
and nibble my flowers?

28:42.760 --> 28:44.240
Does this mean

28:44.320 --> 28:47.720
I'm destined to be with Lord Changheng?

28:49.280 --> 28:51.600
You're unpredictable and unsteady.

28:56.720 --> 28:58.520
Where is that coming from?

29:07.560 --> 29:10.320
Every time she sees Changheng,
she's always smiling.

29:11.800 --> 29:14.920
All she feels is sadness when I'm around.

29:24.200 --> 29:25.080
That's right.

29:25.920 --> 29:28.640
I always leave her alone
and be mean to her.

29:28.720 --> 29:30.280
I always make her cry.

29:31.040 --> 29:33.480
It's only natural
that she doesn't like me.

29:33.560 --> 29:34.840
My lord.

29:34.920 --> 29:35.920
I think…

29:49.280 --> 29:50.880
Xiao Run, I'm sorry.

29:50.960 --> 29:52.080
I should go now.

30:04.160 --> 30:06.320
Excuse me.
Where is the gentleman who was here?

30:06.400 --> 30:07.880
He seems to have gone over there.

30:12.840 --> 30:13.720
Sir.

30:14.440 --> 30:15.400
Sir.

30:16.960 --> 30:17.840
Sir.

30:18.400 --> 30:19.240
Big Blockhead.

30:19.760 --> 30:22.120
Big Blockhead, I finally found you.

30:22.800 --> 30:24.640
I have something to say to you.

30:24.720 --> 30:25.640
Speak up.

30:26.600 --> 30:27.760
I have an appointment.

30:28.560 --> 30:29.480
What appointment?

30:31.560 --> 30:32.400
Sir.

30:33.120 --> 30:36.560
Lady Wanqing is already in the boat,
waiting for a long time.

30:37.560 --> 30:39.400
Are you really going
to enjoy the moon with her?

30:40.240 --> 30:42.120
Yes. What's wrong?

30:42.200 --> 30:44.160
Didn't you say you wouldn't go?

30:44.240 --> 30:45.920
I've changed my mind.

30:47.240 --> 30:48.640
You're not going.

30:51.800 --> 30:52.720
Why?

30:53.920 --> 30:54.800
Because…

30:58.080 --> 30:58.960
No reason.

31:00.560 --> 31:02.560
Do I have to ask your permission

31:02.640 --> 31:04.480
on whom I'm meeting with now?

31:11.760 --> 31:12.880
Fairy Orchid.

31:28.400 --> 31:29.360
The wedding dress?

31:37.160 --> 31:39.040
Isn't this a woman's dress?

31:46.960 --> 31:49.760
"Lady Orchid's wedding dress."

31:50.520 --> 31:52.360
Qu Shui, you've got the wrong one.

31:57.200 --> 31:59.440
Yes, I did.
I'll go to their house to change it.

32:22.640 --> 32:24.360
I said I don't need your company.

32:24.440 --> 32:25.560
It's just a few steps.

32:25.640 --> 32:27.480
I'm just going to change
the wedding dress.

32:36.880 --> 32:37.960
Why?

32:38.040 --> 32:39.160
You're not happy now?

32:41.280 --> 32:42.440
I know.

32:42.520 --> 32:44.960
I shouldn't have bothered
your meeting with that Qu Shui.

32:47.160 --> 32:48.320
Stupid Black Dragon.

32:48.400 --> 32:49.800
Why can't you turn around?

32:49.880 --> 32:51.640
Flower Festival is coming up in two days.

32:51.720 --> 32:53.600
Once Lady Wanqing dies,

32:53.680 --> 32:55.840
do you think Moon Supreme Lord
will let Xiao Run get away?

32:56.400 --> 32:58.720
He'll definitely kill him too.

32:58.800 --> 33:01.840
Then Qu Shui surely will not be able
to live either.

33:02.680 --> 33:04.160
They're going to die anyway.

33:07.280 --> 33:08.160
Let's go.

33:18.440 --> 33:20.040
They're going to kill Xiao Run.

33:21.280 --> 33:22.880
It's all a conspiracy.

33:23.680 --> 33:24.920
I have to tell Xiao Run.

33:31.880 --> 33:33.920
You dropped your stuff. Your stuff.

33:35.800 --> 33:36.640
A conspiracy.

33:37.600 --> 33:38.520
It's a conspiracy.

33:54.920 --> 33:58.120
SHENSHUI HALL, SHUIYUNTIAN

34:22.639 --> 34:24.560
Lord Changheng is going
through the tribulation.

34:25.400 --> 34:26.639
It is better to return

34:27.159 --> 34:28.760
the Magical Firefly Stone to him.

34:31.159 --> 34:32.600
Even if it's a gift from Changheng,

34:33.600 --> 34:35.600
you don't have to hold it
in your hand all day long.

34:37.199 --> 34:39.239
I can't believe you remembered to return.

34:39.320 --> 34:41.040
The moon is shining at this time.

34:41.120 --> 34:43.800
Wouldn't it be better for you to drink
and enjoy the moon until dawn

34:43.880 --> 34:44.880
with the beautiful lady?

34:44.960 --> 34:47.520
I was just faking it.

34:47.600 --> 34:50.199
You should be the one
who wants to enjoy the moon until dawn.

34:51.880 --> 34:52.960
Why?

34:53.040 --> 34:55.040
You're so excited about
getting married to Changheng

34:55.120 --> 34:56.679
that you can't fall asleep?

34:58.880 --> 35:00.640
That's a reminder.

35:00.720 --> 35:02.920
I haven't tried on the wedding crown yet.

35:03.000 --> 35:04.120
That's right.

35:04.920 --> 35:06.680
I'm going to try on the wedding dress too.

35:07.480 --> 35:08.840
Lady Orchid.

35:09.480 --> 35:10.400
Help yourself.

35:17.400 --> 35:19.680
You're the biggest idiot
in the three realms.

35:32.800 --> 35:33.880
Fairy Danyin

35:33.960 --> 35:36.520
let the immortal criminal
escape from Haotian Tower,

35:36.600 --> 35:37.640
committing a serious crime.

35:37.720 --> 35:38.880
According to the Immortal Law,

35:38.960 --> 35:41.880
you'll be stripped of your immortal bone
and sent to Shenshui Hall,

35:41.960 --> 35:43.440
staying in the mortal world forever.

35:44.720 --> 35:45.560
Your Highness.

35:45.640 --> 35:47.240
Danyin is young and reckless.

35:47.320 --> 35:48.960
It's all because I didn't teach her well.

35:49.040 --> 35:51.480
I'll suffer on behalf of her.
I hope that Your Highness…

35:53.080 --> 35:54.040
Danyin.

35:55.000 --> 35:57.280
Would you take the blame
and make a success of it?

35:59.800 --> 36:01.880
At Your Highness's command.

36:02.440 --> 36:03.760
Go back to Yunmeng Lake.

36:04.320 --> 36:06.720
Kill the first God of War's
reincarnated body.

36:06.800 --> 36:08.120
Destroy his spirit

36:08.200 --> 36:10.480
and stop Dongfang Qingcang

36:10.560 --> 36:13.200
from unlocking
the 100,000 Moon Tribe soldiers.

36:15.400 --> 36:16.320
No way.

36:18.040 --> 36:19.720
Nonsense! Don't be rude!

36:19.800 --> 36:21.480
Please think twice, Your Highness.

36:21.560 --> 36:22.720
Lord Changheng

36:22.800 --> 36:24.920
is closely related to the fate
of the first God of War.

36:25.000 --> 36:26.520
If you kill the first God of War…

36:26.600 --> 36:27.560
If

36:28.280 --> 36:30.960
Lord Changheng
thus also fails in his reincarnation,

36:31.600 --> 36:32.960
he will be destroyed and scattered.

36:33.040 --> 36:35.640
Changheng dared to escape
from Haotian Tower

36:36.120 --> 36:38.800
and go to Shenshui Hall
to go through the reincarnation

36:38.880 --> 36:40.120
to save the Moon Tribe spy,

36:40.200 --> 36:41.800
repeatedly breaking the rules of heaven,

36:41.880 --> 36:43.680
ignorant of heaven's rules.

36:43.760 --> 36:45.880
Even if he comes back alive,

36:45.960 --> 36:48.000
he'll still be a sinner of Shuiyuntian.

36:52.720 --> 36:54.240
Thirty thousand years ago,

36:54.320 --> 36:57.920
the first God of War also sealed
100,000 Moon Tribe soldiers with his life

36:58.000 --> 37:00.440
for the peace in Shuiyuntian.

37:01.400 --> 37:03.520
Since Changheng is the God of War,

37:04.280 --> 37:07.360
he should take responsibility.

37:13.640 --> 37:14.680
Your Highness,

37:15.400 --> 37:18.480
please take back the order
and spare Lord Changheng's life.

37:18.560 --> 37:19.560
I would rather

37:20.480 --> 37:22.400
have my own immortal bone removed.

37:33.920 --> 37:34.920
Your Highness is merciful.

37:36.200 --> 37:37.080
Danyin

37:37.880 --> 37:39.320
will not fail to fulfill her mission.

37:43.680 --> 37:44.680
Now go.
